#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail

cat <<'MANUAL'
============================================================
ASYRAF NEOVIM FULL MANUAL
============================================================

Command buka manual ini:

  nvim help

Manual ini dibuat untuk setup Neovim terbaru kamu:
- VSCode-like keymap
- Telescope search
- NvimTree file explorer
- Bufferline tab-like buffer
- Lualine statusline
- ToggleTerm terminal
- Treesitter syntax
- nvim-cmp autocomplete
- LSP untuk PHP/Laravel, Go, Lua, JS/TS, HTML, CSS, JSON
- Formatter Conform
- Multi-cursor vim-visual-multi
- Comment.nvim
- nvim-autopairs
- gitsigns
- tmux
- Codex CLI

============================================================
0. KONSEP PALING PENTING
============================================================

Neovim bukan seperti VSCode biasa.
Neovim punya MODE.

------------------------------------------------------------
NORMAL MODE
------------------------------------------------------------

Ini mode utama.
Dipakai untuk:
- navigasi
- copy
- paste
- delete
- search
- replace
- pindah file
- command editor

Balik ke Normal Mode:

  Esc

------------------------------------------------------------
INSERT MODE
------------------------------------------------------------

Ini mode mengetik.

Masuk Insert Mode:

  i    ketik sebelum cursor
  a    ketik setelah cursor
  o    buat baris baru di bawah lalu ketik
  O    buat baris baru di atas lalu ketik

Keluar Insert Mode:

  Esc

------------------------------------------------------------
VISUAL MODE
------------------------------------------------------------

Ini mode select teks.

  v        select per karakter
  V        select per baris
  Ctrl+q   visual block / select kolom

Catatan:
Ctrl+v di config kamu dipakai untuk paste seperti VSCode.
Karena itu visual block dipindah ke Ctrl+q.

------------------------------------------------------------
RULE BESAR
------------------------------------------------------------

Kalau mau mengetik huruf manual:
  pakai i / a / o / O

Kalau mau copy, paste, search, replace, delete, pindah:
  tetap di Normal Mode

============================================================
1. LEADER KEY
============================================================

Leader kamu adalah:

  Space

Kalau tertulis:

  Space fg

Artinya:
- tekan Space
- lalu tekan f
- lalu tekan g

Bukan ditekan bersamaan.

============================================================
2. FILE EXPLORER / SIDEBAR
============================================================

Plugin:

  nvim-tree.lua

Mirip Explorer di VSCode.

Buka/tutup file explorer:

  Ctrl+e

Catatan:
Dulu config kamu pakai Ctrl+n.
Config terbaru pakai Ctrl+e supaya lebih mirip Explorer.

Di dalam NvimTree:

  Enter    buka file/folder
  a        buat file/folder
  r        rename
  d        delete
  x        cut / move
  c        copy
  p        paste
  q        tutup tree

Cara buat file:

  tekan a
  ketik nama file, contoh:
  app/Http/Controllers/TestController.php

Cara buat folder:

  tekan a
  ketik nama folder dengan slash akhir:
  app/Services/

Cara move file:

  arahkan cursor ke file
  tekan x
  arahkan ke folder tujuan
  tekan p

============================================================
3. SEARCH FILE DAN SEARCH TEXT
============================================================

Plugin:

  telescope.nvim

Dependency system:

  ripgrep
  fd

------------------------------------------------------------
Cari file seperti VSCode Ctrl+P
------------------------------------------------------------

  Ctrl+p

Atau versi Vim-style:

  Space ff

------------------------------------------------------------
Cari teks di file aktif seperti VSCode Ctrl+F
------------------------------------------------------------

  Ctrl+f

Ini membuka fuzzy search untuk buffer/file yang sedang aktif.

Cara bawaan Vim juga bisa:

  /kata

Lalu:

  n    next match
  N    previous match

------------------------------------------------------------
Cari teks seluruh project seperti VSCode Ctrl+Shift+F
------------------------------------------------------------

  Ctrl+Shift+f

Kalau terminal kamu tidak membaca Ctrl+Shift+f, pakai:

  Space fg

Ini lebih pasti jalan di terminal.

------------------------------------------------------------
Cari kata di bawah cursor dalam seluruh project
------------------------------------------------------------

  Space fw

Contoh:
cursor ada di kata User.
Tekan Space fw.
Telescope akan cari User di seluruh project.

============================================================
4. COPY / PASTE / CUT
============================================================

Clipboard kamu sudah pakai:

  unnamedplus

Dan di Openbox/X11 kamu sudah install:

  xclip

Artinya:
- copy dari browser/Word bisa paste ke Neovim
- copy dari Neovim bisa paste ke browser/Word

------------------------------------------------------------
Vim-native
------------------------------------------------------------

Copy 1 baris:

  yy

Copy 5 baris:

  5yy

Copy 1 kata:

  yw

Copy dari cursor sampai akhir baris:

  y$

Copy selection:

  pilih dengan v / V
  tekan y

Paste setelah cursor:

  p

Paste sebelum cursor:

  P

Cut 1 baris:

  dd

Cut 5 baris:

  5dd

Cut selection:

  pilih teks
  tekan d

Delete karakter di cursor:

  x

Delete karakter sebelum cursor saat insert:

  Backspace

------------------------------------------------------------
VSCode-like keymap
------------------------------------------------------------

Select all:

  Ctrl+a

Copy:

  Ctrl+c

Cut:

  Ctrl+x

Paste:

  Ctrl+v

Save:

  Ctrl+s

Undo:

  Ctrl+z

Redo:

  Ctrl+y

Catatan:
Di Normal Mode, Ctrl+c copy 1 baris.
Di Visual Mode, Ctrl+c copy selection.

============================================================
5. SELECT TEXT
============================================================

Select karakter:

  v

Select baris:

  V

Select block / kolom:

  Ctrl+q

Setelah select:

  y        copy
  d        cut/delete
  c        delete lalu masuk insert
  >        indent kanan
  <        indent kiri
  gc       comment/uncomment selection

Config terbaru juga punya:

  Tab        indent selection
  Shift+Tab  unindent selection

============================================================
6. MULTI-CURSOR / CTRL+D SEPERTI VSCODE
============================================================

Plugin:

  vim-visual-multi

Tujuan:
Mirip VSCode Ctrl+D.

Cara pakai:

1. Taruh cursor di kata.
2. Tekan:

   Ctrl+d

3. Tekan lagi Ctrl+d untuk pilih match berikutnya.
4. Setelah beberapa kata terseleksi, ketik perubahan.
5. Semua cursor ikut berubah.

Contoh:
Ada beberapa kata:

  user
  user
  user

Taruh cursor di user pertama.
Tekan Ctrl+d beberapa kali.
Ketik customer.
Semua pilihan berubah.

Catatan:
Kalau multi-cursor terasa aneh, tekan Esc beberapa kali untuk keluar.

============================================================
7. REPLACE / GANTI TEKS
============================================================

------------------------------------------------------------
Replace semua dalam file
------------------------------------------------------------

  :%s/lama/baru/g

Contoh:

  :%s/user/customer/g

------------------------------------------------------------
Replace dengan konfirmasi satu-satu
------------------------------------------------------------

  :%s/lama/baru/gc

Saat muncul pertanyaan:

  y    replace ini
  n    skip ini
  a    replace semua sisanya
  q    stop

------------------------------------------------------------
Replace kata di bawah cursor
------------------------------------------------------------

Config kamu punya:

  Space rw

Cara:
1. Taruh cursor di kata.
2. Tekan Space rw.
3. Isi kata pengganti.
4. Confirm satu-satu.

============================================================
8. UNDO / REDO
============================================================

Vim-native:

  u        undo
  Ctrl+r   redo

VSCode-like:

  Ctrl+z   undo
  Ctrl+y   redo

============================================================
9. SAVE / QUIT / AUTOSAVE
============================================================

Save:

  Ctrl+s

Atau:

  :w

Quit:

  :q

Save and quit:

  :wq

Force quit tanpa simpan:

  :q!

Config kamu punya autosave.

Autosave jalan saat:
- keluar Insert Mode
- text berubah

Tapi tetap pakai Ctrl+s kalau ingin aman.

============================================================
10. BUFFER / TAB FILE
============================================================

Plugin:

  bufferline.nvim

Di Neovim, file terbuka disebut:

  buffer

Bufferline membuat buffer terlihat seperti tab di atas.

Pindah buffer berikutnya:

  Tab

Pindah buffer sebelumnya:

  Shift+Tab

List buffer:

  Space fb

Close buffer:

  Space bd

Command manual:

  :ls       lihat semua buffer
  :bn       buffer next
  :bp       buffer previous
  :bd       delete/close buffer

Catatan:
Tab asli Neovim beda dengan buffer.
Untuk kerja harian, pakai buffer saja.

============================================================
11. TERMINAL DI DALAM NEOVIM
============================================================

Plugin:

  toggleterm.nvim

Buka/tutup terminal bawah:

  Ctrl+\

Atau:

  Space tt

Terminal vertical:

  Space tv

Terminal floating:

  Space tf

Keluar dari terminal mode:

  Ctrl+\ lalu Ctrl+n

Catatan:
Kalau kamu pakai tmux, ToggleTerm tetap opsional.
Untuk banyak CLI, tmux lebih kuat.

============================================================
12. TMUX
============================================================

Tmux adalah terminal multiplexer.
Fungsinya seperti banyak terminal dalam 1 window.

Masuk tmux:

  tmux

------------------------------------------------------------
Pane / split
------------------------------------------------------------

Split vertical kiri-kanan:

  Ctrl+b lalu %

Split horizontal atas-bawah:

  Ctrl+b lalu "

Pindah pane:

  Ctrl+b lalu panah

Tutup pane:

  Ctrl+b lalu x
  lalu y

Atau dari shell:

  exit

------------------------------------------------------------
Window tmux
------------------------------------------------------------

Window baru:

  Ctrl+b lalu c

Window berikutnya:

  Ctrl+b lalu n

Window sebelumnya:

  Ctrl+b lalu p

Rename window:

  Ctrl+b lalu ,

------------------------------------------------------------
Session
------------------------------------------------------------

Detach dari tmux:

  Ctrl+b lalu d

Lihat session:

  tmux ls

Masuk lagi:

  tmux attach

Kill session:

  tmux kill-session -t nama_session

------------------------------------------------------------
Workflow Laravel dengan tmux
------------------------------------------------------------

Contoh layout:

Pane 1:

  nvim .

Pane 2:

  php artisan serve

Pane 3:

  npm run dev

Pane 4:

  php artisan queue:work

Pane 5:

  tail -f storage/logs/laravel.log

Pane 6:

  codex

============================================================
13. COMMENT / UNCOMMENT
============================================================

Plugin:

  Comment.nvim

Comment 1 baris:

  gcc

Comment selection:

  pilih teks
  tekan gc

VSCode-like:

  Ctrl+/

Catatan:
Di banyak terminal, Ctrl+/ kadang tidak terbaca.
Kalau tidak jalan, pakai gcc atau gc.

============================================================
14. AUTOPAIRS
============================================================

Plugin:

  nvim-autopairs

Fungsi:
Saat ketik pembuka, otomatis bikin penutup.

Contoh:

  (  menjadi  ()
  {  menjadi  {}
  [  menjadi  []
  "  menjadi  ""
  '  menjadi  ''

============================================================
15. AUTOCOMPLETE
============================================================

Plugin:

  nvim-cmp
  cmp-nvim-lsp
  LuaSnip
  cmp_luasnip
  friendly-snippets

Autocomplete muncul saat mengetik.

Manual trigger:

  Ctrl+Space

Pilih item berikutnya:

  Tab

Pilih item sebelumnya:

  Shift+Tab

Confirm pilihan:

  Enter

Snippet:
Kalau snippet tersedia, Tab bisa lompat antar placeholder.

============================================================
16. LSP / INTELLISENSE
============================================================

Plugin:

  nvim-lspconfig
  mason.nvim
  mason-lspconfig.nvim

LSP yang disiapkan:

  gopls
  intelephense
  lua_ls
  ts_ls
  html
  cssls
  jsonls
  emmet_language_server

------------------------------------------------------------
Key LSP
------------------------------------------------------------

Go to definition:

  gd

Find references:

  gr

Hover documentation:

  K

Rename symbol:

  Space rn

Code action:

  Space ca

Diagnostic under cursor:

  Space dd

Diagnostic sebelumnya:

  [d

Diagnostic berikutnya:

  ]d

Masukkan diagnostic ke loclist:

  Space dq

------------------------------------------------------------
PHP / Laravel
------------------------------------------------------------

LSP PHP:

  intelephense

Fungsi:
- autocomplete class PHP
- go to definition
- references
- hover
- rename symbol
- diagnostics

Catatan:
Untuk hasil terbaik, buka Neovim dari root project Laravel, bukan dari subfolder terlalu dalam.

Contoh:

  cd ~/Code/laravel/bengkel2
  nvim .

Bukan:

  cd ~/Code/laravel/bengkel2/app
  nvim .

Kenapa?
LSP lebih mudah membaca composer.json, vendor, routes, app, config, dll.

============================================================
17. FORMATTER / RAPIKAN KODE
============================================================

Plugin:

  conform.nvim

Formatter yang disiapkan:

  PHP              pint
  JavaScript       prettier
  TypeScript       prettier
  React JS         prettier
  React TS         prettier
  HTML             prettier
  CSS              prettier
  JSON             prettier
  Lua              stylua

Format manual:

  Space fm

Format on save:
Aktif untuk beberapa filetype di config.

------------------------------------------------------------
Catatan penting PHP / Laravel Pint
------------------------------------------------------------

Config memakai formatter:

  pint

Biasanya di Laravel tersedia sebagai:

  vendor/bin/pint

Cek:

  ls vendor/bin/pint

Kalau ada:

  ./vendor/bin/pint

Kalau tidak ada, install via composer sesuai kebutuhan project.

============================================================
18. TREESITTER / SYNTAX HIGHLIGHTING
============================================================

Plugin:

  nvim-treesitter

Fungsi:
- syntax highlight lebih akurat
- indent lebih pintar
- parsing struktur kode

Bahasa yang disiapkan:

  lua
  vim
  vimdoc
  php
  html
  css
  javascript
  typescript
  json
  go
  bash

Command penting:

  :TSInstallInfo

Update parser:

  :TSUpdate

Catatan:
Config kamu dipin ke branch master agar cocok dengan config Treesitter lama.

============================================================
19. GIT INDICATOR
============================================================

Plugin:

  gitsigns.nvim

Fungsi:
Menampilkan tanda perubahan Git di kiri baris.

Biasanya terlihat:
- baris baru
- baris berubah
- baris dihapus

Ini mirip gutter Git di VSCode.

============================================================
20. STATUSLINE
============================================================

Plugin:

  lualine.nvim

Fungsi:
Bar bawah yang menampilkan info seperti:
- mode
- file
- branch
- diagnostics
- posisi cursor

============================================================
21. DASHBOARD
============================================================

Plugin:

  alpha-nvim

Fungsi:
Tampilan awal saat buka Neovim tanpa file.

Menu:
- Find file
- Search text
- Explorer
- New file
- Quit

============================================================
22. ICON
============================================================

Plugin:

  nvim-web-devicons

Fungsi:
Memberi icon file/folder untuk:
- NvimTree
- Telescope
- Bufferline
- Lualine
- Dashboard

============================================================
23. CODEX CLI
============================================================

Codex sudah kamu install via npm global user directory.

Jalankan dari root project:

  codex

Di dalam tmux:
- buat pane khusus
- jalankan codex di situ

Di dalam Neovim:
- buka terminal dengan Space tt atau Ctrl+\
- jalankan:

  codex

Command berguna dalam Codex:

  /model
  /logout
  /skills

Workflow:
1. cd ke root project
2. buka tmux
3. pane 1: nvim .
4. pane 2: codex
5. pane 3: php artisan serve
6. pane 4: npm run dev

============================================================
24. DEPENDENCY SYSTEM YANG KAMU INSTALL
============================================================

Pacman packages:

  ripgrep
  fd
  unzip
  xclip
  nodejs
  npm
  php
  composer
  tmux

Fungsi:

ripgrep:
  search text cepat untuk Telescope live_grep

fd:
  pencarian file cepat untuk Telescope

unzip:
  dibutuhkan beberapa installer/tooling

xclip:
  clipboard provider untuk Openbox/X11

nodejs:
  runtime JS

npm:
  install package JS dan Codex CLI

php:
  runtime PHP untuk Laravel

composer:
  package manager PHP/Laravel

tmux:
  multi terminal / terminal multiplexer

============================================================
25. CHECK HEALTH / TROUBLESHOOTING
============================================================

Cek semua health:

  :checkhealth

Cek plugin:

  :Lazy

Sync/update plugin:

  :Lazy sync

Cek Mason:

  :Mason

Cek LSP aktif:

  :LspInfo

Cek Treesitter:

  :TSInstallInfo

Cek clipboard:

  :checkhealth provider

Cek path command di shell:

  which nvim
  type nvim

============================================================
26. TROUBLESHOOTING CLIPBOARD
============================================================

Kalau copy-paste tidak nyambung dengan sistem:

1. Pastikan di init.lua ada:

   vim.opt.clipboard = "unnamedplus"

2. Karena kamu pakai Openbox/X11, pastikan:

   xclip

3. Test:

   echo test | xclip -selection clipboard

Lalu paste di app lain.

============================================================
27. TROUBLESHOOTING CTRL+SHIFT+F
============================================================

Kalau Ctrl+Shift+F tidak membuka search project, itu biasanya karena terminal emulator tidak mengirim kombinasi itu ke Neovim.

Solusi pasti:

  Space fg

Ini mapping Vim-style dan lebih stabil.

============================================================
28. TROUBLESHOOTING CTRL+/
============================================================

Kalau Ctrl+/ tidak comment:

Pakai:

  gcc

Untuk selection:

  gc

Ini lebih stabil dibanding Ctrl+/ di terminal.

============================================================
29. COMMAND VIM PENTING
============================================================

Buka file:

  :e path/file

Save:

  :w

Quit:

  :q

Save quit:

  :wq

Force quit:

  :q!

Reload file dari disk:

  :e!

Cari:

  /kata

Replace semua:

  :%s/lama/baru/g

Replace confirm:

  :%s/lama/baru/gc

Pilih semua:

  ggVG

Copy semua:

  ggVGy

Delete semua:

  ggVGd

Ke awal file:

  gg

Ke akhir file:

  G

Ke line 20:

  :20

============================================================
30. WORKFLOW HARIAN YANG DISARANKAN
============================================================

Untuk Laravel:

  cd ~/Code/laravel/bengkel2
  tmux

Di tmux:

Pane 1:

  nvim .

Pane 2:

  php artisan serve

Pane 3:

  npm run dev

Pane 4:

  tail -f storage/logs/laravel.log

Pane 5:

  codex

Di Neovim:

  Ctrl+p       cari file
  Space fg     cari teks project
  Ctrl+e       explorer
  gd           go to definition
  K            hover docs
  Space rn     rename
  Space ca     code action
  Space fm     format
  Ctrl+d       multi-cursor
  Tab          next buffer
  Shift+Tab    prev buffer

============================================================
31. MAPPING CEPAT VSCODE KE NEOVIM KAMU
============================================================

VSCode                         Neovim kamu

Ctrl+P                         Ctrl+p
Ctrl+F                         Ctrl+f atau /kata
Ctrl+Shift+F                   Ctrl+Shift+f atau Space fg
Ctrl+A                         Ctrl+a
Ctrl+C                         Ctrl+c
Ctrl+X                         Ctrl+x
Ctrl+V                         Ctrl+v
Ctrl+S                         Ctrl+s
Ctrl+Z                         Ctrl+z
Ctrl+Y                         Ctrl+y
Ctrl+D                         Ctrl+d
Explorer                       Ctrl+e
Terminal                       Ctrl+\ atau Space tt
Format Document                Space fm
Rename Symbol                  Space rn
Code Action                    Space ca
Go to Definition               gd
Find References                gr
Hover                          K
Next tab                       Tab
Previous tab                   Shift+Tab
Close tab/buffer               Space bd
Comment line                   gcc atau Ctrl+/
Comment selection              visual lalu gc
Visual block                   Ctrl+q

============================================================
32. JIKA BINGUNG, INGAT 7 TOMBOL INI
============================================================

Esc       balik ke Normal Mode
i         mulai mengetik
Ctrl+p    cari file
Space fg  cari teks project
Ctrl+e    buka explorer
Ctrl+s    save
u         undo

